          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Ezra 4:24–5:2; 6:14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Siku ya kwanza ya mwezi wa sita mwaka wa pili wa utawala wa mfalme Dario wa Persia, Mwenyezi-Mungu alimpa Hagai ujumbe aupeleke kwa Zerubabeli mwana wa Shealtieli, mkuu wa Yuda, na kuhani mkuu Yoshua mwana wa Yehosadaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hagai akasema: “Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi asema hivi: Watu hawa wanasema kwamba wakati wa kulijenga upya hekalu langu haujafika.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Mwenyezi-Mungu ameniambia mimi nabii Hagai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Je, ni sawa kwenu kukaa katika majumba yenu ya fahari hali hekalu langu ni magofu matupu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasa, asema hivi Mwenyezi-Mungu: “Fikirini kama mnafanya sawa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyinyi mmepanda mbegu kwa wingi, lakini mmevuna kidogo; mnakula, lakini hamshibi; mnakunywa divai, lakini hamtosheki; mnavaa nguo, lakini bado mnasikia baridi; mfanyakazi mshahara wake huwa kama umetumbukizwa katika mfuko uliotoboka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi asema hivi: “Fikirini kama mnafanya sawa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasa, basi, nendeni milimani mkalete miti, mlijenge upya hilo hekalu, nipate kulifurahia na kutukuzwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mlitazamia mavuno mengi, lakini mlipata kidogo tu. Na mlipoyaleta nyumbani, niliyapeperusha mbali. Kwa nini? Kwa sababu hekalu langu ni magofu matupu hali kila mmoja wenu anashughulikia nyumba yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndio maana mbingu zimeacha kunyesha mvua, nayo ardhi haioteshi mavuno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimeleta ukame nchini, ukaathiri vilima na mashamba ya nafaka, mashamba ya mizabibu na mashamba ya mizeituni na kila mmea, watu na wanyama, na chochote mlichotolea jasho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Zerubabeli mwana wa Shealtieli, na kuhani mkuu Yoshua mwana wa Yehosadaki, pamoja na watu wote waliokuwa wamerudi kutoka uhamishoni",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "waliokuwa wamerudi kutoka uhamishoni:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Au waliokuwa wamebaki nchini.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wakafanya kama Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wao alivyowaambia na kama walivyoambiwa na nabii Hagai, kama alivyotumwa na Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wao. Watu wakamcha Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Hagai, mjumbe wa Mwenyezi-Mungu, akawapa watu ujumbe ufuatao kutoka kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu: Mwenyezi-Mungu asema: “Mimi nipo pamoja nanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Mwenyezi-Mungu akawapa moyo Zerubabeli mkuu wa Yuda, kuhani mkuu Yoshua na watu wote waliokuwa wamerudi kutoka uhamishoni, walishughulikie hekalu. Walianza kazi hiyo ya kulijenga upya hekalu la Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi, Mungu wao, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mnamo siku ya ishirini na nne ya mwezi wa sita, mwaka wa pili wa utawala wa mfalme Dario.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
